@prefix : <http://example.org/orexis/world/greenhouse#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .
@prefix execution: <http://example.org/orexis/execution#> .
@prefix sensing: <http://example.org/orexis/sensing#> .
@prefix prediction: <http://example.org/orexis/prediction#> .

<> a orexis:SelfGraph .    # this document is one graph, and this is what it is

#  WHO THIS AGENT IS: the grower, and this document is its own by the self it states. Booted as
#  "grower", the agent checks that this is so.
#
#  WHAT IT RUNS, in the packages' words, since no domain has one for a grower: it observes its bed's
#  sensors and foresees them, plans for the bed it wants comfortable and walks the plans through its
#  pump and heater. An observer is a deliberator too, so its sides are concluded.

:grower a orexis:Self , planning:Planner , execution:Executor , sensing:Observer , prediction:Predictor .
